### Banking Transactions API — Sample Requests
### Open this file in VS Code with the "REST Client" extension and click "Send Request"
### above any block below. The server must be running on http://localhost:8080
### (see ../HOWTORUN.md).

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080

### Create a deposit
POST {{baseUrl}}/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "type": "deposit",
  "toAccount": "ACC-12345",
  "amount": 500.00,
  "currency": "USD"
}

### Create a withdrawal
POST {{baseUrl}}/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "type": "withdrawal",
  "fromAccount": "ACC-12345",
  "amount": 75.25,
  "currency": "USD"
}

### Create a transfer
POST {{baseUrl}}/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "type": "transfer",
  "fromAccount": "ACC-12345",
  "toAccount": "ACC-67890",
  "amount": 100.50,
  "currency": "USD"
}

### Validation error example — negative amount and unsupported currency
POST {{baseUrl}}/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "type": "deposit",
  "toAccount": "ACC-12345",
  "amount": -5,
  "currency": "XXX"
}

### List all transactions
GET {{baseUrl}}/transactions

### Filter by account
GET {{baseUrl}}/transactions?accountId=ACC-12345

### Filter by type
GET {{baseUrl}}/transactions?type=deposit

### Filter by date range (combine with other filters freely)
GET {{baseUrl}}/transactions?from=2024-01-01&to=2030-12-31

### Get a transaction by id — replace {id} with a real id from a create response above
GET {{baseUrl}}/transactions/{id}

### Get a transaction by a malformed id -> 400
GET {{baseUrl}}/transactions/not-a-uuid

### Get a transaction that doesn't exist -> 404
GET {{baseUrl}}/transactions/00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000000

### Get account balance
### Note: newly created transactions start as "pending"; only "completed"
### transactions count toward the balance, so this returns 0.00 unless the
### in-memory data has been seeded with completed transactions.
GET {{baseUrl}}/accounts/ACC-12345/balance

### Get account balance — malformed account id -> 400
GET {{baseUrl}}/accounts/bad-id/balance

### Get account balance — unknown account -> 404
GET {{baseUrl}}/accounts/ACC-99999/balance

### Get account summary
GET {{baseUrl}}/accounts/ACC-12345/summary
